WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:02.335
Mars 2020 Perserverance
Lands on Mars!

2
00:00:02.402 --> 00:00:03.937
We are starting the
Straighten Up and

3
00:00:04.003 --> 00:00:05.405
Fly Right maneuver

4
00:00:05.472 --> 00:00:07.407
in preparation for
parachute deploy

5
00:00:07.474 --> 00:00:08.675
[Music]

6
00:00:08.742 --> 00:00:09.142
[Whoosh. Click.]

7
00:00:10.744 --> 00:00:14.447
The navigator has confirmed that the parachute has deployed

8
00:00:14.514 --> 00:00:16.683
and we are seeing
significant deceleration.

9
00:00:16.750 --> 00:00:17.751
[Music]

10
00:00:19.419 --> 00:00:21.087
[Click
Wind whooshing]

11
00:00:21.154 --> 00:00:23.256
Skycrane maneuver
has started.

12
00:00:25.325 --> 00:00:26.326
[Rockets roar]

13
00:00:27.660 --> 00:00:29.362
About 20 meters
off the surface.

14
00:00:30.029 --> 00:00:31.598
[Control voice unintelligible]

15
00:00:31.664 --> 00:00:33.666
[Rockets roar]

16
00:00:36.302 --> 00:00:38.071
Touchdown confirmed!

17
00:00:38.138 --> 00:00:41.274
Perseverance safely
on the surface of Mars

18
00:00:41.341 --> 00:00:43.343
ready to begin seeking
signs of past life@

19
00:00:49.883 --> 00:00:52.419
Looks like we're getting
the first image.

20
00:00:52.485 --> 00:00:54.754
[Applause continues]

21
00:00:54.821 --> 00:00:55.989
This is the most amazing thing!

22
00:00:56.055 --> 00:00:57.323
This is what NASA does.

23
00:00:57.390 --> 00:00:59.592
This is what we can do
as a country.

24
00:00:59.659 --> 00:01:00.593
[Music]
